{
  "name": "Planar Strike",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you deal damage to a creature with Planar Warrior, you can choose to impose one of the following effects:</p><ul><li><strong>Planar Pulse.</strong> You deal the damage of Planar Warrior to all creatures of your choice within 10 ft of your target.</li><li><strong>Sealing Strike.</strong> The target has to make a Charisma Saving Throw. On a failure, it cannot teleport move to a different Plane through any means until the start of your next turn.</li><li><strong>Teleporting Strike.</strong> The target has to make a Charisma Saving Throw or be teleported 30 ft horizontally to an unoccupied space your choice that is on a solid surface.</li></ul>",
